Create a transform that scales about a point other than the origin.

# Examples

```
# use kurbo::{Point, TranslateScale};
# fn assert_near(p0: Point, p1: Point) {
#   assert!((p1 - p0).hypot() < 1e-9, "{p0:?} != {p1:?}");
